id":"x-pack/plugin/searchable-snapshots/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/searchablesnapshots/SearchableSnapshotsCanMatchOnCoordinatorIntegTests.java-x-pack/plugin/searchable-snapshots/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/searchablesnapshots/SearchableSnapshotsCanMatchOnCoordinatorIntegTests.java--53402:61333","promptId":"#5Z0R6","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/searchable-snapshots/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/searchablesnapshots/SearchableSnapshotsCanMatchOnCoordinatorIntegTests.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/searchable-snapshots/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/searchablesnapshots/SearchableSnapshotsCanMatchOnCoordinatorIntegTests.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":53402,"endPos":61333,"startLine":974,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":1113,"endLineOffset":5,"length":7932}]}]}],"groundTruthGeneratedCommentsNodes":[{"groundTruth":{"original_line":114,"line":162,"comment_lines":["[][162]"],"review_comment":["It seems redundant that we are returning both the tier and exposing the constant field type too. Can\u0027t we get the current tier from the artificial data tier field type?","I believe we need the `tier` as the `CoordinatorRewriteContext` doesn\u0027t know of `indexSettings` otherwise https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/114990/files/67f82e9aa742e223de4cd6a76d496ac66987130e#diff-45c9ed5af87237215a5a11f3d2549aa678272c2cbc898b866b43516ec992fab5R60\r\nThe index settings would be needed for us to parse the `_tier_preference` setting.\r\n\r\nI\u0027m not sure if it should ? Or if we should keep just passing the `tier` ? It _seems_ that passing the tier is a smaller change (easier to test too). ","I was under the impression that that is the same value that the constant field type that the context exposes returns, or is that something else?","The field type does not store any state but every time it evaluates it reaches out to the index settings for the `_tier_preference` value https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/114990/files/67f82e9aa742e223de4cd6a76d496ac66987130e#diff-e776fbfb85ffa7c76ad9fbbd1263953047589070bf15add46298deaf929778dbR95\r\n\r\nThe `QueryWriteContext` stores the index settings (but the `CoordinatorRewriteContext` doesn\u0027t)","sounds good, I had misunderstood."],"path":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/CoordinatorRewriteContext.java","id":35576,"created_at":"2024-10-21T10:56:11Z","original_position":63,"side":"RIGHT","position":123,"submitted_on_commit":"67f82e9aa742e223de4cd6a76d496ac66987130e","diff_hunk":"@@ -99,4 +108,8 @@ public IndexLongFieldRange getFieldRange(String fieldName) {\n     public CoordinatorRewriteContext convertToCoordinatorRewriteContext() {\n         return this;\n     }\n+\n+    public String tier() {\n+        return tier;\n+    }","submitted_line":114},"generatedCommentsNodes":[]}],"coveredGroundTruth":0,"uncoveredGroundTruth":1,"coveredMatchable":21,"uncoveredMatchable":25,"timing":105236,"tokensIn":17569,"tokensOut":1177}